Actually, there is a way to gain up to 25 strength without using any
strength items.  I have never tried it myself, but I read about it
here a long time ago.  As I said, I've never tried it, and it is
a bug, so the Dev Team may have fixed it.  Then again, maybe not.
Anyway, here it is ---->

Needed: One unicorn horn
        Some food, various types.  Fruits preferred, rather than larger
        food items.

When you're weak from hunger, you lose a strength point.  They 
say you can apply a unicorn horn to gain this back, and then
eat food to return to hungry status, gaining another strength point.
They say you should be able to attain a 25 strength this way, if you're
patient.

